{
  "schema": "cablesim.plugin/2",
  "id": "cablesim.comsol-bridge",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "name": "COMSOL 参考对照",
  "description": "独立运行用户已安装的 COMSOL 6.2，对同一 SI 问题作可选内部基准比较；平台开源计算不依赖它。",
  "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
  "publisher": {
    "id": "cablesim",
    "name": "CableSimPro"
  },
  "host_api": {
    "major": 2,
    "min_minor": 1
  },
  "license": {
    "spdx": "LicenseRef-Project-Undeclared",
    "review_required": true
  },
  "platforms": [
    "windows-x64",
    "linux-x64"
  ],
  "runtime": {
    "kind": "python",
    "python": ">=3.11,<3.14",
    "entry": "src/cablesim_comsol_bridge/main.py"
  },
  "permissions": [
    "project.read",
    "study.run",
    "artifact.write"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "resources": {
    "timeout_s": 1800,
    "memory_mb": 8192,
    "network": "none"
  },
  "capabilities": [
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "electrothermal-reference",
      "title": "COMSOL 电热耦合对照",
      "method_version": "electrothermal-reference/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.electrothermal/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.maximum-temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "section",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "Native FrequencyStationary sigma(T) versus independent GetDP/heat FEM; plugin-tests/test_comsol_native.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "原生A-u与稳态导热，点式sigma(T)，仅全外边界恒温；需COMSOL/ACDC/HEATTRANSFER有效许可。",
        "同轴基准不是完整06教程；本地商业求解仅供可选内部对照。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "magnetic-reference",
      "title": "COMSOL 二维涡流对照",
      "method_version": "magnetic-reference/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "frequency_domain",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.simulation-problem/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.joule-loss",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.reproduction-report",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "E05/E17/E18: tests/compare_papers.py; finite exterior and paper-statistic limitations retained",
          "COMSOL tutorial04 plain/series magnetic submodels: tests/compare_tutorial.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "二维原生 Magnetic Fields，显式恒定各向同性材料、RMS 电流/电压及理想串并联组；外边界 A=0。",
        "需要用户自备有效商业许可证和 COMSOL 6.2；缺安装、版本或模块即明确拒算，不回退到近似。",
        "仅为可选内部对照，平台不分发 COMSOL 模型、程序、库或许可证；不同离散与模型假设必须单独核验。",
        "COMSOL 串行运行；本地宿主 Job Object 控制进程树。Windows 内存预算声明不等于操作系统硬限制。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "thermal-reference",
      "title": "COMSOL 稳态与暂态热对照",
      "method_version": "thermal-reference/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.simulation-problem/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.maximum-temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "section",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.reproduction-report",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "analytic-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "Layered radial conductor: plugin-tests/test_comsol_native.py; native steady solution versus independent analytic temperature"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "二维原生 Heat Transfer in Solids；恒定热物性、逐域热源、外边界或指定坐标恒温。暂态使用显式初温、分段热源及固定时间步 BDF；不支持内孔、辐射或温变电阻。",
        "需要用户自备有效商业许可证和 COMSOL 6.2；缺安装、版本或模块即明确拒算，不回退到近似。",
        "仅为可选内部对照，平台不分发 COMSOL 模型、程序、库或许可证；不同离散与模型假设必须单独核验。",
        "COMSOL 串行运行；本地宿主 Job Object 控制进程树。Windows 内存预算声明不等于操作系统硬限制。"
      ]
    }
  ],
